flowchart LR
  User["Owner / Team Member"]

  subgraph Browser["Browser · React 19 + TypeScript"]
    UI["Web UI<br/>Individual mode · Project mode<br/>Playground · BranchPoint · Security results"]
  end

  subgraph Server["Single-node control plane · Node.js + Fastify"]
    API["Fastify API boundary<br/>Bearer identity · Zod validation<br/>RBAC · JSON + SSE"]

    subgraph Middleware["Team-designed middleware"]
      Agent["AgentService<br/>CRUD · Runs · messages · traces<br/>checkpoints · restore · branch/thread fork<br/>branch merge · audit"]
      Project["ProjectService<br/>projects · membership · role policy<br/>workspace isolation · Agent promotion<br/>commit gate + requests"]
      Security["Security gate<br/>diff vs main → static pre-check<br/>one bounded direct model call if clean<br/>targeted per-file fix → re-scan"]
      History["WorkspaceHistory / BranchPoint<br/>manifests · hashes · diffs<br/>immutable snapshots · recovery copies<br/>verified in-place restore + rollback"]
      Session["Native session fork<br/>SQLite index + JSONL rollout offset<br/>independent Codex thread IDs"]
    end

    Store[("JsonStore<br/>data/launchpad.json<br/>users · Agents · projects · Runs<br/>messages · traces · checkpoints<br/>security verdicts · audit")]
    Workspaces[("Managed workspaces<br/>standalone/&lt;agent&gt;<br/>projects/&lt;project&gt;/main<br/>projects/&lt;project&gt;/members/&lt;member&gt;<br/>branches nested under their Agent")]
    Snapshots[("BranchPoint files<br/>snapshots/&lt;id&gt;<br/>restores/&lt;checkpoint-time&gt;")]
    CodexHome[("Codex home<br/>thread/session state")]

    Runner{"AgentRunner"}
    Container["Local POC<br/>disposable Docker / Colima / Podman<br/>resource limits · dropped capabilities<br/>selected workspace bind mount"]
    Process["Local development / ECS<br/>Codex CLI child process<br/>same application host/container"]
    Classifier["arkClassify<br/>single non-streaming Responses call<br/>no Agent loop · tools · chat history"]
  end

  Ark["Volcengine Ark<br/>Responses API"]

  User --> UI
  UI <-->|"Bearer JSON requests<br/>SSE live traces"| API
  API --> Agent
  API --> Project

  Agent <--> Store
  Project <--> Store
  Agent <--> Workspaces
  Project <--> Workspaces
  Agent --> History
  Project --> History
  History <--> Snapshots
  Agent --> Session
  Session <--> CodexHome

  Agent --> Runner
  Runner -->|"container profile"| Container
  Runner -->|"process / ECS profile"| Process
  Container <--> Workspaces
  Container <--> CodexHome
  Process <--> Workspaces
  Process <--> CodexHome
  Container --> Ark
  Process --> Ark

  Project --> Security
  Security -->|"clean static pass"| Classifier
  Classifier --> Ark
  Security -->|"hash-bound verdict + audit"| Store

